## Authentication

The provider authenticates to Commander Service Mode using an API key. You can configure it directly or via environment variables:

| Provider Attribute     | Environment Variable              | Description                          |
|------------------------|-----------------------------------|--------------------------------------|
| `service_mode_url`     | `COMMANDER_SERVICE_MODE_URL`      | URL of the Commander Service Mode    |
| `service_mode_api_key` | `COMMANDER_SERVICE_MODE_API_KEY`  | API key for authentication           |

Using environment variables:

```shell
export COMMANDER_SERVICE_MODE_URL="https://your-commander-service.example.com"
export COMMANDER_SERVICE_MODE_API_KEY="your-api-key"
```

```terraform
# No explicit configuration needed when using environment variables
provider "commander" {}
```

